You're now the owner of a project
==================================

<%= @previous_owner.name_with_email %> made you the owner of
"<%= @project.title %>" on PreTeXt.Plus. You can now manage its
collaborators and settings, and its quotas and limits follow your own
account from now on. <%= @previous_owner.name_with_email %> is now a
collaborator on the project:

<%= project_url(@project) %>

You are receiving this because you have an account on PreTeXt.Plus
(https://pretext.plus).
